00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:15.480
Shut up, that's the best!

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:17.070
<b>Depressed</b>

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:17.160
<i>This is the worst.</i>

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.940
