with other hotties.

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:33.430
That's really too bad.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.170
A feast for the eyes.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.100
Thanks so much.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:38.950
No problem.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.690
You wanted to go check 
the bookstore, right?

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.400
I was meaning to stop by there anyway.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.720
Happy

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.720
